[E0436] Error: `text` is used after `h`, which it refers to, was changed
    ╭─[ err/189_owned_guard_bindings/main.wip:14:5 ]
    │
 10 │     val .Some(text) = h.text else {
    │               ──┬─
    │                 ╰─── `text` refers to `h`
    │
 13 │     h.text = .None
    │     ───┬──
    │        ╰──── `h` assigned here
 14 │     text.len()
    │     ──┬─
    │       ╰─── used here
    │
    │ Help: use `text` before `h` changes, or take what is needed from it before then
    │
    │ Note: a binding of a pattern on a place refers to the place, so the place must not change while the binding is still used
────╯
